---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { questions } from '../data/profile';
---
<Layout title="Research directions" description="Kunhee Ryu’s research interests: transferable representations, predicting the consequences of actions, and deciding when to acquire more information.">
  <section class="page-head wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Research directions</span><h1>Understand the structure.<br /><em>Anticipate the change.</em></h1><p>I’m interested in how AI uses learned relationships in new situations and predicts the consequences of its actions.</p><span class="direction-subtitle">A research agenda, grounded in the questions my work has opened.</span></section>
  <div class="agenda-map wrap" aria-label="Three connected research directions"><a href="#represent"><span>01</span>Represent <i>↘</i></a><a href="#anticipate"><span>02</span>Anticipate <i>↘</i></a><a href="#inquire"><span>03</span>Inquire <i>↗</i></a></div>
  <div class="wrap">{questions.map(q=><section class="direction-section" id={q.id}><div class="direction-number">{q.number}<span class="eyebrow">{q.label}</span></div><div class="direction-content"><h2>{q.title}</h2><p class="direction-question">{q.question}</p><p>{q.body}</p><div class="direction-method"><div><h3>Possible approaches</h3><p>{q.approach}</p></div><div><h3>What to evaluate</h3><p>{q.measure}</p></div></div><div class="direction-connection"><span class="eyebrow">Where it connects</span><p>{q.connection}</p><a href={`/research/${q.paper}/`} class="inline-link">Read the related research ↗</a></div></div></section>)}</div>
  <section class="applications wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Where these questions matter</span><h2>Scientific discovery.<br />Autonomous systems.<br /><em>Human judgment.</em></h2><p>Scientific work requires evidence from different sources. Autonomous systems turn predictions into sequences of actions. In both, a person may need to inspect a decision or intervene. These settings offer ways to examine how learning, reasoning, and planning work together.</p><a href="mailto:rgh00826@yonsei.ac.kr" class="text-link">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
</Layout>
